# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Raven Hill

step Abercrombie
  tip Head west to the hermit once more.
  turnin 159
  accept 133

step Ghoul Ribs
  tip Every ghoul of the Raven Hill Cemetery's northern half can drop a rib: Flesh Eaters and Bone Chewers (24-27) are the easier kills; Plague Spreaders and Brain Eaters (27-29) drop them too. Mor'Ladim, an elite, wanders the graves: keep away from him.
  tip Careful: A Rotted One casts Summon Flesh Eating Worms as it dies, which brings extra adds.
  tip Careful: Lord Malathrom (31) and Commander Felstrom (32), both rares, haunt the cemetery's north and west, and Morbent Fel (32, elite) keeps to the house at its western edge: leave them be.
  collect 884 quest 133
  kill 604 quest 58                       -- Plague Spreader, for The Night Watch

step Abercrombie
  turnin 133
  accept 134

