  tip Careful: Mor'Ladim, an elite (35), wanders these graves too, and Commander Felstrom (32, rare) haunts the west part: keep away from both.
  kill 1110 quest 323                     -- Skeletal Raider
  kill 787 quest 323                      -- Skeletal Healer
